# NVD JSON 2.0 yearly feeds used by the CVE classification study.
#
# Each line: <sha256>  <filename>  <source-url>
#
# The sha256 column is filled in by the first successful
# download_nvd run; subsequent runs re-verify and refuse to
# silently re-download a mismatch. The committed checksums lock
# the dataset to a known good snapshot so paper figures stay
# reproducible across re-runs.
#
# Snapshot date: 2026-05-24 (first download run).
#
# Total cache size: ~140 MB; cache/ is gitignored, not in the
# repo. Anyone with the venv + network can re-run
# `python -m evaluation.cve.download_nvd` to recreate it
# bit-for-bit.

# checksums populated by first run:
